<title>USA: Renters Choice Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Renters Choice Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>					    1997			1996</p>
<p> Total Revenue		 $74,587,000		$49,002,000</p>
<p> Operating Profit		9,639,000		  6,344,000</p>
<p> Net Earnings		    5,412,000		  3,617,000</p>
<p> Net Earnings Per Share	     0.22			 0.15</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said same-store sales rose 9.6 percent in Q1 1997 compared with the same quarter last year.</p>
<p>The company said it acquired 29 stores in Q1 1997, ending the quarter with 452.</p>
</text>
